{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45033","headline":"奉酬李员外使君嘉佑苏台屏营居春首有怀 · 皎然","name":"奉酬李员外使君嘉佑苏台屏营居春首有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔岁爲邦初未识，今朝休沐始相亲。\n移家水巷贫依静，种柳风窗欲占春。\n诗思先邀乌府客，山情还访白楼人。\n登临许作烟霞伴，高在方袍间幅巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}